Usage: hops td read [OPTIONS] FEATURE_VIEW FV_VERSION

  Retrieve a previously materialized training dataset.

  Args:     ctx: Click context.     feature_view: Feature view name.
  fv_version: Feature view version.     td_version: Training dataset version.
  split: Optional split name.     output_file: Optional file to write the
  dataframe to.     n: Max rows rendered when no ``--output`` file is given.

Options:
  --td-version INTEGER    Training dataset version to retrieve.  [required]
  --split TEXT            Split to read when the TD was created with a split,
                          e.g. "train".
  --output PATH           Write to a file.
  --n INTEGER             Max rows to render.  [default: 100]
  --json / --no-json      Force JSON / force human tables (default: JSON when
                          piped).
  --verify / --no-verify  Verify the Hopsworks TLS certificate; --no-verify
                          skips verification for self-signed / IP-SAN-
                          mismatched certs.
  -h, --help              Show this message and exit.
